            <history xml:id="history_id0c3d9d37">
               <p xml:id="idm244">Gade's little suite depicts a typical Danish Christmas in the second part of the 19th century, a tradition that in many ways is similar to the present one. The pieces were published in December 1859 and soon became very popular, not only in Denmark, but also in Germany.</p>
            </history>
